cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or refer to Anno Computatri, please cite the white paper below."
title: "anno-computatri: converters between CE, Anno Computatri and Unix time"
abstract: "Anno Computatri (AC) is a calendar that counts years from 1970, the Unix epoch used by Unix, Linux, macOS, Android and iOS, so 1970 CE is year 0 AC. Originated by Gabor Mayer in 2023."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
url: "https://annocomputatri.net/"
